# StratonHub Docs Rules (Delta Only)
Applies on top of `00-global.always.mdc`. Do NOT restate global rules.

## Diataxis Enforcement
- Each page must be exactly ONE type:
  - tutorial | how-to | reference | explanation
- Never mix types in one page. Link to other pages instead.

## Mandatory Page Header (First Screen)
Every page must start with:
1) Purpose (1 sentence)
2) Audience (developers | business | users)
3) When to use this page
4) Prerequisites (if any)

## Anti-Bloat
- No duplicated SOP steps across pages.
- No duplicated reference tables across pages.
- If content repeats: extract to a canonical page or MDX component.
